***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** Cloudflare API token for cert-manager's DNS-01 solver. Copy to `secret.yaml`,
***REMOVED*** fill in. ArgoCD manages it.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp secret.yaml.example secret.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR secret.yaml
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** Create a Cloudflare API token with Zone:DNS:Edit for the zones you issue
***REMOVED*** certificates for. The key MUST be named `api-token` (matches the
***REMOVED*** apiTokenSecretRef in clusterIssuer.yaml).
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
    annotations:
        argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: "5"
    name: cloudflare-api-token-secret
    namespace: cert-manager
type: Opaque
stringData:
    api-token: REPLACE_WITH_CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
